(7735511, 1275129, 141319, '<td valign="top">Very nice and moody</td>', 'Very nice and moody', '2022-12-26 01:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735512, 1275073, 141319, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, just think the format should be a little shorter. Obviously you don''t :-D, just wanted to give feedback.</td>', 'I like the shot, just think the format should be a little shorter. Obviously you don''t :-D, just wanted to give feedback.', '2022-12-26 01:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735519, 1275073, 29535, '<td valign="top">So closed must my mind be and my composition theory so static that the idea of photographing something at the edge of the frame didn''t even enter my head, but what a great idea and beautiful execution. Shows that there is more to photography than the rule of thirds.</td>', 'So closed must my mind be and my composition theory so static that the idea of photographing something at the edge of the frame didn''t even enter my head, but what a great idea and beautiful execution. Shows that there is more to photography than the rule of thirds.', '2022-12-26 04:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735520, 1275192, 29535, '<td valign="top">You know whilst I can tell the camera is struggling in the low light I can absolutely see what you were going for here and the composition is an interesting scene. There are elements of it I would change if possibile but I think you got the challenge and this is an interesting juxtaposition of light.</td>', 'You know whilst I can tell the camera is struggling in the low light I can absolutely see what you were going for here and the composition is an interesting scene. There are elements of it I would change if possibile but I think you got the challenge and this is an interesting juxtaposition of light.', '2022-12-26 04:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735521, 1275189, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is a nice fit for the challenge. I''m not sure on the DOF here... I feel like the bridge is too middling between in and out of focus. It''s hard to say if everything in focus or just her in focus would have been better, but this kind of in the middle isn''t doing it for me. Just IMO though, others may disagree. It''s a great idea and concept.</td>', 'This is a nice fit for the challenge. I''m not sure on the DOF here... I feel like the bridge is too middling between in and out of focus. It''s hard to say if everything in focus or just her in focus would have been better, but this kind of in the middle isn''t doing it for me. Just IMO though, others may disagree. It''s a great idea and concept.', '2022-12-26 04:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735522, 1275176, 29535, '<td valign="top">You must''ve been wrestling hard with that sunlight to get the exposure you needed and boy did you pull it off. Stunning lighting across the photo and a fantastic composition.</td>', 'You must''ve been wrestling hard with that sunlight to get the exposure you needed and boy did you pull it off. Stunning lighting across the photo and a fantastic composition.', '2022-12-26 04:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735578, 1275187, 29535, '<td valign="top">First impressions are I love this and the concept of being on the edge of opening the store. The colours are fantastic, lighting as well. At first I was like ''oh but the horizon is crooked'' but... it works. In fact it feels better that it''s slightly off and I think it''s a creative choice. It''s not a picture-perfect scene, it''s a tight little convenience store with strip lighting not a mountain range and it wouldn''t make sense to be ''perfect''. Love it!</td>', 'First impressions are I love this and the concept of being on the edge of opening the store. The colours are fantastic, lighting as well. At first I was like ''oh but the horizon is crooked'' but... it works. In fact it feels better that it''s slightly off and I think it''s a creative choice. It''s not a picture-perfect scene, it''s a tight little convenience store with strip lighting not a mountain range and it wouldn''t make sense to be ''perfect''. Love it!', '2022-12-26 14:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735633, 1275107, 91360, '<td valign="top">very creative!</td>', 'very creative!', '2022-12-27 11:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735698, 1275083, 114285, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. I love the balance.</td>', 'Pretty shot. I love the balance.', '2022-12-28 08:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735744, 1275022, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not only did you grasp the concept of the challenge head on, you captured a beautiful image in the process.  Bravo!  Well done.</td>', 'Not only did you grasp the concept of the challenge head on, you captured a beautiful image in the process.  Bravo!  Well done.', '2022-12-29 20:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735745, 1275091, 30049, '<td valign="top">Intriguing!  Lovely image.</td>', 'Intriguing!  Lovely image.', '2022-12-29 20:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
